  "raw_label": "1",
  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Manoj Kumar vs The State Of Bihar on 21 November, 2022",
    "facts": "In the present case, the petitioner seeks bail in connection with G.R. No. 2946 of 2021 arising out of Kotwali P.S. Case No. 235 of 2021 registered for the alleged offences under Sections 272, 273 and 34 of the Indian Penal Code, Section 7 of the Essential Commodities Act and Sections 52, 59 and 63 of the Food Safety and Standards Act 2006. The prosecution case is that a raid was conducted on the shop in the house of the co-accused Om Prakash and a large Patna High Court CR. MISC. No.57633 of 2022( 2) dt.21-11-2022 number of tins of different brands of edible oil, ghee, unbranded tins of refined oil, empty tins, containers, gas cylinders, different equipment for adulteration and mixing and stickers of different brands were recovered from the shop of the co-accused. The co- accused Om Prakash gave a written statement that the co- accused gave his shop on rent to the petitioner who has been doing the business of ghee. Thus, the allegation against the petitioner and other co-accused persons is that of adulteration of edible oil and selling it under fraudulent transaction by putting different stickers.",
    "arguments": "The learned counsel for the petitioner submits that petitioner is innocent and has been falsely implicated in this case. The petitioner was not apprehended from the spot and nothing incriminating has come on record to show the connection of the petitioner with the recovered articles. Learned counsel further submits that it is not a case under Section 7 of the Essential Commodities Act.",
    "petitioner_arguments": "The learned counsel for the petitioner submits that petitioner is innocent and has been falsely implicated in this case. The petitioner was not apprehended from the spot and nothing incriminating has come on record to show the connection of the petitioner with the recovered articles. Learned counsel further submits that it is not a case under Section 7 of the Essential Commodities Act.",
    "respondent_arguments": "",
    "other_lawyer_arguments": ""
  },
